+# UI Interaction
+
+Reusable Angular interaction infrastructure for JZ Studio applications and libraries.
+
+The first feature extracted into this library will be the CDK Overlay-based popover framework.
+
+## Build
+
+```bash
+npx ng build ui-interaction
+```
